title: Rudolf Breitscheid
is-pinned-card: true 
tags: advisor, centrist
card-image: img/portraits/BreitscheidRudolf.jpg
new-page: true
view-if: breitscheid_advisor = 1

= Rudolf Breitscheid

Breitscheid is [? if chancellor = "Breitscheid": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Breitscheid": the current President and ?] a long-time SPD leader, who was at one time part of the anti-war USPD. He came from a working-class family, but has a doctorate degree and started his political career as a liberal.

- @breitscheid_international
- @breitscheid_foreign
- @party_discipline
- @chancellor
- @president
- @end_game
- @root: Return to main

@breitscheid_international
title: International Party Relations
subtitle: Breitscheid is one of our contacts with international socialist parties.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; international_relations_timer -= 12; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: international_relations

@breitscheid_foreign
title: Foreign Policy
subtitle: As Foreign Minister, Breitscheid can set our foreign policy.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not spd_in_government: The SPD is not in government. ?] [? if foreign_minister_party != "SPD" : The SPD does not control the Foreign Ministry. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and spd_in_government and foreign_minister_party == "SPD"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; foreign_policy_timer -= 8; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: foreign_policy


@party_discipline
title: Party Discipline
subtitle: Reduce dissent across the party.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 5; labor_dissent -= 10; center_dissent -= 10; reformist_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_dissent -= 5

We have enforced party discipline to reduce dissent across all factions.


@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Breitscheid can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Breitscheid"
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Breitscheid can make use of their position to further our goals.
view if: president == "Breitscheid"

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
